#: mvp_compliance/models.py:447
msgid ""
"The account that accepted this version, at the time it accepted it. Null "
"only ever means the account has since been removed — never that the acceptor "
"was unknown."
msgstr ""
"The account that accepted this version, at the time it accepted it. Null "
"only ever means the account has since been removed — never that the acceptor "
"was unknown."

#: mvp_compliance/models.py:457
msgid "subject"
msgstr "subject"

#: mvp_compliance/models.py:461
msgid ""
"The accepted user's primary key, held as text and written once, when this "
"record is made. The `user` foreign key is cleared when that account is "
"removed, so without this field the record could no longer say whose it is or "
"be found among that person's others."
msgstr ""
"The accepted user's primary key, held as text and written once, when this "
"record is made. The `user` foreign key is cleared when that account is "
"removed, so without this field the record could no longer say whose it is or "
"be found among that person's others."

#: mvp_compliance/models.py:471
msgid ""
