"personal data about someone who did not ask for it to be kept, so it is the "
"host project's decision."
msgstr ""
"The address the request came from when this acceptance was recorded. Held "
"only when the host project has turned that on and supplied the request — "
"personal data about someone who did not ask for it to be kept, so it is the "
"host project's decision."

